---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import HeroBanner from '../components/HeroBanner.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Current Projects | GLINT Research"
  description="Explore GLINT's ongoing multicentre research projects in gastroenterology, including Dose & Dispose and the BOS Study."
>
  <HeroBanner
    title="Current Projects"
    subtitle="Our ongoing multicentre research initiatives advancing gastroenterology practice across London and the UK."
  />

  <section class="container py-16 md:py-20">
    <div class="flex flex-col gap-10">

      <!-- Project 1: Dose & Dispose -->
      <article class="card-elevated p-8 md:p-10">
        <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3 mb-4">
          <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-serif font-bold text-foreground">
            Dose &amp; Dispose: The Hidden Cost of Wasted Sedation in Endoscopy
          </h2>
          <span class="badge badge-secondary">Data Analysis</span>
        </div>

        <p class="text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed mb-8">
          We are conducting a multicentre, retrospective service evaluation assessing sedation-disposal
          practices over a two-week period. The primary aim is to quantify the amount of wasted IV
          sedation agents (midazolam, fentanyl, and buscopan) during endoscopic procedures, with a
          view to identifying opportunities to reduce waste and improve sustainability.
        </p>

        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
          <!-- Objectives -->
          <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <div class="icon-box flex-shrink-0">
              <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="6"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="2"/>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <div>
              <h3 class="font-semibold text-foreground mb-2">Objectives</h3>
              <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-1 text-sm text-muted-foreground">
                <li>Quantify wasted IV sedation agents across endoscopy units</li>
                <li>Identify opportunities to reduce pharmaceutical waste</li>
                <li>Improve sustainability practices in endoscopy</li>
              </ul>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Timeline -->
          <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <div class="icon-box flex-shrink-0">
              <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                <rect x="3" y="4" width="18" height="18" rx="2" ry="2"/><line x1="16" y1="2" x2="16" y2="6"/><line x1="8" y1="2" x2="8" y2="6"/><line x1="3" y1="10" x2="21" y2="10"/>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <div>
              <h3 class="font-semibold text-foreground mb-2">Timeline</h3>
              <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground">2025 - Ongoing</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Network -->
          <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <div class="icon-box flex-shrink-0">
              <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                <path d="M17 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H5a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"/><circle cx="9" cy="7" r="4"/><path d="M23 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87"/><path d="M16 3.13a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.75"/>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <div>
              <h3 class="font-semibold text-foreground mb-2">Network</h3>
              <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground">10+ London centres</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="mt-8">
          <a href="/contact" class="btn btn-sm btn-primary">
            Get Involved
            <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M14 5l7 7m0 0l-7 7m7-7H3" />
            </svg>
          </a>
        </div>
      </article>

      <!-- Project 2: BOS Study -->
      <article class="card-elevated p-8 md:p-10">
        <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3 mb-4">
          <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-serif font-bold text-foreground">
            BOS - Endoscopic Dilation of Benign Oesophageal Strictures
          </h2>
          <span class="badge badge-primary">Write-Up Phase</span>
        </div>

        <p class="text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed mb-8">
          A large multicentre evaluation of real-world practice in endoscopic dilation of benign
          oesophageal strictures. This project has been presented at the MESSE conference in Berlin
          in October 2025 and involves 11+ centres across the UK.
        </p>

        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
          <!-- Objectives -->
          <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <div class="icon-box flex-shrink-0">
              <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="6"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="2"/>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <div>
              <h3 class="font-semibold text-foreground mb-2">Objectives</h3>
              <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-1 text-sm text-muted-foreground">
                <li>Evaluate real-world dilation practices across UK centres</li>
                <li>Assess clinical outcomes and safety profiles</li>
                <li>Identify best practices and standardisation opportunities</li>
              </ul>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Timeline -->
          <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <div class="icon-box flex-shrink-0">
              <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                <rect x="3" y="4" width="18" height="18" rx="2" ry="2"/><line x1="16" y1="2" x2="16" y2="6"/><line x1="8" y1="2" x2="8" y2="6"/><line x1="3" y1="10" x2="21" y2="10"/>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <div>
              <h3 class="font-semibold text-foreground mb-2">Timeline</h3>
              <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground">2024 - Ongoing</p>
              <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground mt-1">Presented at MESSE Conference, Berlin, October 2025</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Network -->
          <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <div class="icon-box flex-shrink-0">
              <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                <path d="M17 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H5a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"/><circle cx="9" cy="7" r="4"/><path d="M23 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87"/><path d="M16 3.13a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.75"/>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <div>
              <h3 class="font-semibold text-foreground mb-2">Network</h3>
              <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground">11+ centres across the UK</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>

    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Bottom CTA -->
  <section class="hero-gradient relative py-16 md:py-24">
    <div class="container relative text-center">
      <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-serif font-semibold text-white mb-4">
        Interested in Collaborating?
      </h2>
      <p class="text-white/80 text-lg max-w-xl mx-auto mb-8">
        We welcome new collaborators to our research network. Get in touch to learn how you can contribute.
      </p>
      <a href="/contact" class="btn btn-white">
        Contact Us
        <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
          <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M14 5l7 7m0 0l-7 7m7-7H3" />
        </svg>
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
